**WHY PASSIVE TRACKING IS THE RIGHT SHAPE, and this is the part worth keeping.** Every entry in
`k/v` arrived because he said a word and I noticed I could not look it up. **The list grows from
FRICTION, not from a decision to build a glossary** — which is the same mechanism as a wormhole row
and the same mechanism as `c4reg reg <word>` answering *at no register*. **Three instruments, one
signal: a word we cannot resolve is the shop telling us where it is thin.**

